The error messages suggest that there is neither a ufs or cdfs file system on
rz4c.  If there is a ufs file system on the CDROM, using "disklabel rz4" should
show this.  Look for "4.2BSD" in the fstype field of the output of disklabel.

If you don't see this, then there isn't the file system that you suspect there
is.  Perhaps the file system is on a partition other than "c"??

